{"title":"싸이코페이스","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=dufrig/hAd4ebE5Mf/gymhxKblrRS1iIeafHXK80&filename=th3","synopsis":"15년 전, 누나를 죽인 살인범을 쫓는 '권경찬'.\n\n파출소 순경이 된 그는 자신의 신분을 숨긴 채, '검은양'이라는 이름으로 세상을 활보하는 다양한 악의 얼굴들을 쫓는다. 나쁜놈들을 잡다보면, 언젠가 누나를 죽인 '그 놈'을 만날 수 있겠지. \n오직 복수를 위해 수단과 방법을 가리지 않고, 범죄자들의 행적을 찾는다. \n\n깡패보다 더 깡패 같은 형사 강철호와 공조를 시작하며 본격적인 추격을 벌이는데. \n그 놈이 다시 움직이기 시작한다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":195,"change":{"type":"down","amount":105}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":239,"change":{"type":"down","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":140,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":204,"change":{"type":"down","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":241,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":290,"change":{"type":"down","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":289,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":151,"change":{"type":"up","amount":138}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":204,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":239,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":285,"change":{"type":"down","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":265,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":272,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":280,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":262,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":259,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":271,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":265,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":285,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":286,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":279,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":277,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":275,"change"